# Instant Help Mermaid Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Flutter as Flutter Mobile App
  participant Backend as Node.js Backend
  participant AI as FastAPI AI Tutor Service
  participant SymPy as SymPy Verification

  Student->>Flutter: Tap "I'm Stuck"
  Flutter->>Student: Open Instant Help Screen
  Student->>Flutter: Submit problem or attempted work
  Flutter-->>Student: Immediate acknowledgement
  Flutter->>Backend: Create Tutor Session + upload metadata
  Backend-->>Flutter: session_id
  Backend->>AI: Analyze problem with student context
  AI->>AI: Detect subject, topic, intent, problem type, support level
  alt unclear
    AI-->>Flutter: One clarification question
    Flutter-->>Student: Ask focused clarification
    Student->>Flutter: Clarification response
    Flutter->>Backend: Append tutor turn
    Backend->>AI: Analyze again
  else unsupported
    AI-->>Flutter: Safe limitation + related supported topic
    Backend->>Backend: Log unsupported case
  else supported
    AI-->>Flutter: First useful hint, visual, first step, or focused question
    Flutter-->>Student: Show immediate tutor response
    loop Interactive teaching
      Student->>Flutter: Answer, revise, ask hint, or explain differently
      Flutter->>Backend: Save student attempt/turn
      Backend->>AI: Evaluate response
      AI-->>Flutter: Feedback + next adaptive step
    end
    AI->>SymPy: Verify step/final expression
    SymPy-->>AI: Verified / partial / failed
    alt verified
      AI-->>Flutter: Verified answer or step
    else failed repeatedly
      AI-->>Flutter: Safe failure message, no confident answer
      Backend->>Backend: Log verification error
    end
    Flutter-->>Student: Understanding check
    Student->>Flutter: Similar practice answer or concept explanation
    Flutter->>Backend: Save progress, activity, streak, weak topic updates
  end
```
